    "name": "Bridge Hunter",
    "steam_appid": 2522290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the entire world rests on your shoulders. The enemy is relying on that strategic bridge to transport their deadly equipment, but you have the power to disrupt their supply line. Take control of a powerful drone and arm yourself with grenades. The environment is your playground, and with a vast array of weapons and abilities at your disposal, you can experiment with different tactics and unleash your full potential. The future of the war is in your hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a skilled drone pilot, you have the power to lead a fleet of five drones into the ultimate battle. Choose from a range of crafts and arm them with deadly weapons such as small bombs, grenades, and even jars filled with pickles. Call in an artillery strike or unleash the power of a nuke or laser beam from a satellite for added destruction. The bridge <strong>must</strong> fall! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/2fffea08c755023095d6fdae2b8db51e.avif?t=1755117633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/f35c0e1f02d35b23e947fec041d158e8.poster.avif?t=1755117633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/f35c0e1f02d35b23e947fec041d158e8.webm?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/f35c0e1f02d35b23e947fec041d158e8.mp4?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to witness an epic display of destruction with many explosions and fully destructible structures that will take your gameplay experience to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/2fffea08c755023095d6fdae2b8db51e.avif?t=1755117633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variety of content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/e9f88d7100c8b5af70ed1c40a9618db1.poster.avif?t=1755117633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/e9f88d7100c8b5af70ed1c40a9618db1.webm?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/e9f88d7100c8b5af70ed1c40a9618db1.mp4?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the full potential of your arsenal! With a wide range of drones, projectiles, special abilities, and upgrades at your disposal, you have everything you need to take your battles to the next level. Prepare to dominate the field and emerge victorious! As development continues, we add additional content for you to play with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/2fffea08c755023095d6fdae2b8db51e.avif?t=1755117633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/fd03281cefae1552b6dd831c9a51518b.poster.avif?t=1755117633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/fd03281cefae1552b6dd831c9a51518b.webm?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/fd03281cefae1552b6dd831c9a51518b.mp4?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power of each drone knows no bounds, with a flare that can call upon the mightiest of support. From FPV swarms to rocket salvos, these special abilities are a force to be reckoned with. And with the ability to unleash a devastating nuke, there's no telling what kind of destruction they can unleash. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/2fffea08c755023095d6fdae2b8db51e.avif?t=1755117633\" /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactive Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/912bc4d68e8d924b0d25303534880e47.poster.avif?t=1755117633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/912bc4d68e8d924b0d25303534880e47.webm?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/912bc4d68e8d924b0d25303534880e47.mp4?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a look around, things interact with each other! Enemy anti-air will try to shoot down your aerial assets. Planes can collide and cause a chain reaction. Your drones will try to return home if the signal is lost. All of that can affect your mission; keep it in mind.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the entire world rests on your shoulders. The enemy is relying on that strategic bridge to transport their deadly equipment, but you have the power to disrupt their supply line. Take control of a powerful drone and arm yourself with grenades. The environment is your playground, and with a vast array of weapons and abilities at your disposal, you can experiment with different tactics and unleash your full potential. The future of the war is in your hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a skilled drone pilot, you have the power to lead a fleet of five drones into the ultimate battle. Choose from a range of crafts and arm them with deadly weapons such as small bombs, grenades, and even jars filled with pickles. Call in an artillery strike or unleash the power of a nuke or laser beam from a satellite for added destruction. The bridge <strong>must</strong> fall! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/2fffea08c755023095d6fdae2b8db51e.avif?t=1755117633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/f35c0e1f02d35b23e947fec041d158e8.poster.avif?t=1755117633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/f35c0e1f02d35b23e947fec041d158e8.webm?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/f35c0e1f02d35b23e947fec041d158e8.mp4?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to witness an epic display of destruction with many explosions and fully destructible structures that will take your gameplay experience to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/2fffea08c755023095d6fdae2b8db51e.avif?t=1755117633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variety of content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/e9f88d7100c8b5af70ed1c40a9618db1.poster.avif?t=1755117633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/e9f88d7100c8b5af70ed1c40a9618db1.webm?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/e9f88d7100c8b5af70ed1c40a9618db1.mp4?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the full potential of your arsenal! With a wide range of drones, projectiles, special abilities, and upgrades at your disposal, you have everything you need to take your battles to the next level. Prepare to dominate the field and emerge victorious! As development continues, we add additional content for you to play with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/2fffea08c755023095d6fdae2b8db51e.avif?t=1755117633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/fd03281cefae1552b6dd831c9a51518b.poster.avif?t=1755117633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/fd03281cefae1552b6dd831c9a51518b.webm?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/fd03281cefae1552b6dd831c9a51518b.mp4?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power of each drone knows no bounds, with a flare that can call upon the mightiest of support. From FPV swarms to rocket salvos, these special abilities are a force to be reckoned with. And with the ability to unleash a devastating nuke, there's no telling what kind of destruction they can unleash. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/2fffea08c755023095d6fdae2b8db51e.avif?t=1755117633\" /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactive Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/912bc4d68e8d924b0d25303534880e47.poster.avif?t=1755117633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/912bc4d68e8d924b0d25303534880e47.webm?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522290/extras/912bc4d68e8d924b0d25303534880e47.mp4?t=1755117633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a look around, things interact with each other! Enemy anti-air will try to shoot down your aerial assets. Planes can collide and cause a chain reaction. Your drones will try to return home if the signal is lost. All of that can affect your mission; keep it in mind.</p>",
